    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Statistical Computing Workshop\"\nsubtitle: \"Northwestern University -- Political Science\"\nformat: \n  html:\n    toc: true\n    title-block-banner: true\n---\n\n\n\n## Fall 2026 Schedule\n\n**Mini Series: Computational Tools for Qualitative Inquiry**\n\n- {{< fa clock >}} &nbsp; 12:30 -- 2:00 PM\n- {{< fa location-dot >}} &nbsp; Virtual or hybrid (see event links for details)\n- {{< fa file-pdf >}} &nbsp; [Full AY 2026-27 schedule](schedule.pdf)\n- {{< fa file-excel >}} &nbsp; [Attendance sheet for registered students](https://forms.office.com/r/m8ZT8aDpVr)\n\n\n\n\n\n```{=html}\n<!-- preamble start -->\n\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vincentarelbundock/tinytable@main/inst/tinytable.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n      // Create table-specific functions using external factory\n      const tableFns_8zbbhb0cu69tbqqdmri7 = TinyTable.createTableFunctions(\"tinytable_8zbbhb0cu69tbqqdmri7\");\n      // tinytable span after\n      window.addEventListener('load', function () {\n          var cellsToStyle = [\n            // tinytable style arrays after\n          { positions: [ { i: '3', j: 1 }, { i: '3', j: 2 }, { i: '3', j: 3 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_1yxpke0q8mj93fod0ufj',}, \n          { positions: [ { i: '0', j: 1 }, { i: '0', j: 2 }, { i: '0', j: 3 } ], css_id: 'tinytable_css_qkncp2ygu3r28hlglzyz',}, \n          ];\n\n          // Loop over the arrays to style the cells\n          cellsToStyle.forEach(function (group) {\n              group.positions.forEach(function (cell) {\n                  tableFns_8zbbhb0cu69tbqqdmri7.styleCell(cell.i, cell.j, group.css_id);\n              });\n          });\n      });\n    </script>\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/vincentarelbundock/tinytable@main/inst/tinytable.css\">\n    <style>\n    /* tinytable css entries after */\n    #tinytable_8zbbhb0cu69tbqqdmri7 td.tinytable_css_1yxpke0q8mj93fod0ufj, #tinytable_8zbbhb0cu69tbqqdmri7 th.tinytable_